  <div class="snp__sec" id="who">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">01</span>Who you're buying from</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>Dalton Pierce is an online store run by Stilhuset Nord, Luboszewy 46, 97-217 Luboszewy, Poland, NIP 7732509014, REGON 528999874. You can always write to us at <a href="mailto:support@daltonpierce.com">support@daltonpierce.com</a> – Monday to Friday, 9:00–18:00 CET.</p>
      <p>These terms apply to every purchase in this store. We sell to consumers with a delivery address in Canada. By placing an order, you accept these terms as they stood at the time of your order.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec" id="items">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">02</span>Items, photos and sizes</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>We work hard to make sure our photos and descriptions show each item as it really is. Colours may still look slightly different on your screen than in real life, depending on your screen settings and the lighting in the photo.</p>
      <p>Sizes vary from line to line. Go by the measurements on the product page rather than the size you usually wear – measure a garment you own and like, and compare. If a measurement is missing, write to us before you order.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec" id="prices">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">03</span>Prices, taxes and discounts</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>All prices are in Canadian dollars (CAD). Any applicable sales taxes (GST/HST/PST) are calculated and shown at checkout before you pay. Shipping is free on every order, and we cover any import duties and fees – nothing extra is charged on delivery. The total at checkout is the total you pay.</p>
      <p>Buy more than one item and you get a multi-buy discount, applied automatically in the cart – no discount code needed:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>2 items: −10%</li>
        <li>3 items: −20%</li>
        <li>4 items: −25%</li>
        <li>5 items or more: −30%</li>
      </ul>
      <p>These discounts can't be combined with each other or with other discount codes.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec" id="agreement">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">04</span>How the agreement is made</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>Once you've placed your order, you'll receive an order confirmation by email. The agreement is binding from that moment, and the order confirmation is your receipt. Check it, and write to us right away if anything is wrong.</p>
      <p>If you haven't received an order confirmation, first check your spam folder and the email address you entered at checkout. If it's still missing, write to us with your name and address and we'll send it again.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec" id="stock">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">05</span>Sold-out items and pricing errors</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>Occasionally an item sells out after you've ordered it. If that happens, we'll let you know right away and refund the full amount for that item. We'll ship the rest of your order as normal, unless you'd rather cancel the whole order.</p>
      <p>We reserve the right to correct obvious errors in prices and descriptions – for example, a price that by mistake shows a fraction of the real one. In that case we'll contact you, and you can choose to complete the purchase at the correct price or get all your money back.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec" id="payment">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">06</span>Payment</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>We accept the payment methods shown at checkout, with no fees. The amount is authorized or charged when you place your order. If the order is cancelled or an item sells out, we refund the amount in full.</p>
      <p>Payment is made over an encrypted connection with our payment providers. We never see or store your card details. Read more on our <a href="/pages/payment-policy">Payment</a> page.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec" id="delivery">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">07</span>Delivery</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <ul>
        <li>We deliver to addresses in Canada – homes, businesses and pickup points.</li>
        <li>We pack and ship your order within 3–4 business days. Delivery then takes 3–6 business days. Allow 6–10 business days in total; remote areas may take a little longer.</li>
        <li>Items ship directly from our makers' warehouses, so an order with several items may arrive in several parcels, each with its own tracking number. This costs nothing extra.</li>
        <li>You'll get a tracking number by email as soon as your parcel ships.</li>
        <li>Risk in the item passes to you once you – or someone you've asked to receive it – have been handed the parcel.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Read more in our <a href="/pages/forsendelsespolitik">shipping and delivery policy</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec" id="cancel">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">08</span>Changes and cancellations</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>To cancel an order, change the delivery address or remove an item, write to us as soon as possible with your order number. There's a short window before the order goes to the warehouse.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Not shipped yet:</strong> we cancel or correct the order and refund the amount for anything you remove.</li>
        <li><strong>Already shipped:</strong> the carrier can't redirect the parcel. Accept it and use your 30-day return right in section 9.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec" id="returns">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">09</span>Returns – 30 days</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <div class="snp__note"><p>You have <strong>30 days</strong> to return an item, counted from the day you receive it.</p></div>
      <p>If your order arrives in several parcels, the 30 days are counted from the day you receive the last parcel.</p>
      <p><strong>How to return.</strong> Write to <a href="mailto:support@daltonpierce.com">support@daltonpierce.com</a> with your order number and the items you'd like to send back before the 30 days are up. We'll reply with the return address and a short guide.</p>
      <p><strong>Wait for our reply before you send anything.</strong> The sender address on the parcel is a warehouse that can't accept returns, and parcels sent there are hard to recover.</p>
      <p><strong>Return shipping.</strong> You pay for return shipping, unless the item is faulty, damaged or not what you ordered. Use a tracked service – the parcel is your responsibility until it reaches us.</p>
      <p><strong>Condition of the item.</strong> You may examine and try on the item as you would in a store. If it has been used beyond that – for example worn, washed or had its tags removed – we may deduct an amount from the refund that reflects the loss in value.</p>
      <p><strong>Refund.</strong> We refund the full amount you paid for the returned items to your original payment method, no later than 14 days after we receive your return or proof that you've sent it. Your bank usually takes another 3–5 business days to show the amount.</p>
      <p><strong>Multi-buy discount and partial returns.</strong> If you bought several items with a multi-buy discount and return only some of them, you get back the amount you actually paid for the returned items – including the discount they received. The discount on the items you keep doesn't change.</p>
      <p><strong>Exchanges.</strong> We don't exchange sizes directly. Send the item back and place a new order in the size you want.</p>
      <p>Sealed hygiene items, such as underwear and piercing jewellery, can't be returned once the seal has been broken after delivery.</p>
      <p>Read more in our <a href="/pages/retur-og-refusionspolitik">returns and refunds policy</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec" id="defects">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">10</span>Faulty items</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>If an item has a defect that was present when you received it, we'll make it right. This doesn't cover normal wear and tear, or damage from incorrect use or washing – always follow the care label in the garment.</p>
      <p>Write to us within a reasonable time after you notice the defect – within 2 months is always on time. Send your order number and a few photos of the defect to <a href="mailto:support@daltonpierce.com">support@daltonpierce.com</a>.</p>
      <p>For a valid claim you get a replacement, a repair or your money back, and we pay the shipping. We can often settle the matter from the photos alone, without you having to send anything back. This doesn't limit any rights you have under the consumer protection laws of your province or territory.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec" id="account">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">11</span>Customer account</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>If you create a customer account, your details must be correct and you must keep your login secure. If you suspect someone else is using your account, write to us right away. You can always ask us to delete your account.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec" id="liability">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">12</span>Liability and events beyond our control</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>Nothing in these terms limits the rights you have as a consumer under the law that applies to you.</p>
      <p>We're not responsible for delays or failed deliveries caused by circumstances beyond our control – for example strikes, natural disasters, pandemics or disruption at carriers. If that happens, we'll let you know, and you can always choose to cancel and get your money back.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec" id="complaints">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">13</span>Complaints</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>If you're unhappy, please write to us first – we almost always find a solution. If we can't agree, you can contact the consumer protection office in your province or territory for free guidance.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec" id="privacy">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">14</span>Personal information and cookies</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>We handle your information as described in our <a href="/pages/betalingspolitik">privacy policy</a>. There you can also read which cookies we use and how to change your choices.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec" id="links">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">15</span>Links to other websites</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>Our site may contain links to other websites, such as carriers' tracking pages. We're not responsible for the content of those sites or how they handle information – their own terms apply.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec" id="changes">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">16</span>Changes and governing law</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>We may update these terms. The date at the top shows the latest change. Your purchase is always covered by the terms that applied when you placed your order.</p>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the province or territory where you live and the federal laws of Canada that apply there. This doesn't take away any protection you have under consumer protection law.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__help">
    <p class="snp__help-title">Any questions?</p>
    <p>Write to us – a real person will reply.</p>
    <a class="snp__btn" href="mailto:support@daltonpierce.com">Email customer service</a>
